==============================================================================
D5  Transfers as the risk weight varies  (Remark 10)
==============================================================================
At eps = 0 insurance is priced at q = rho, so premium = expected payout and
every agent is indifferent: the market is redundant. As eps grows, q tilts
toward the tail and the premium separates from the expected payout.

